			x: 37.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58ADF60AC2BD2DD7"]
			description: ["Keep a neutronium pellet, census II, the equation of state chart, a half-sled and four optical mainframes in the store. The gate looks for them before it opens further."]
